 lets Claude Code, Codex and Cursor write build123d CAD and export STEP, STL and 3MF. Our container test, limits, rivals.","datePublished":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","dateModified":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Andrew","url":"https://andrew.ooo/about/","jobTitle":"Technical Founder","knowsAbout":["AI agents","large language models","self-hosting","automation","developer tools"],"sameAs":["https://github.com/andreihirvi","https://andrewdotooo.substack.com","https://dev.to/andrew-ooo","https://www.reddit.com/user/andrew-ooo/"]},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"andrew.ooo","url":"https://andrew.ooo","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://andrew.ooo/logo.png","width":1024,"height":1024},"description":"Technical blog about AI agents, OpenClaw, and self-hosting","sameAs":["https://github.com/andreihirvi","https://andrewdotooo.substack.com","https://dev.to/andrew-ooo","https://www.reddit.com/user/andrew-ooo/"],"publishingPrinciples":"https://andrew.ooo/editorial-policy/","correctionsPolicy":"https://andrew.ooo/editorial-policy/#corrections"},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://andrew.ooo/posts/text-to-cad-review-agent-cad-plugin/"},"keywords":"text-to-cad, cadgen, cad, build123d, 3d-printing, claude-code, codex, agent-skills, mcp, open-source, tool-review, github-trending","isAccessibleForFree":true,"publishingPrinciples":"https://andrew.ooo/editorial-policy/","citation":[{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"earthtojake/text-to-cad on GitHub","url":"https://github.com/earthtojake/text-to-cad"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"text-to-cad v0.7.19 release notes","url":"https://github.com/earthtojake/text-to-cad/releases/tag/v0.7.19"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"CAD skill (SKILL.md)","url":"https://github.com/earthtojake/text-to-cad/blob/main/skills/cad/SKILL.md"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"DFM skill (SKILL.md)","url":"https://github.com/earthtojake/text-to-cad/blob/main/skills/dfm/SKILL.md"},{"@type":"Creat