 the MIT plugin that lets Claude Code, Codex and Cursor write build123d CAD and export STEP, STL and 3MF. Our container test, limits, rivals.</p> </header> <aside class="evidence" aria-label="Checked facts and hands-on test" data-astro-cid-xyqj6rpw><p class="facts" data-astro-cid-xyqj6rpw><strong data-astro-cid-xyqj6rpw>Repository facts, checked Oct 24, 2026:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/earthtojake/text-to-cad" rel="noopener" data-astro-cid-xyqj6rpw>earthtojake/text-to-cad</a> · 22,809 stars (+1,494 in 7 days) · latest release v0.7.26 (Oct 20, 2026) · last commit Oct 23, 2026 · MIT license · 3 open issues. <a href="/reference/open-source-ai-tools/" data-astro-cid-xyqj6rpw>All tracked tools</a></p><div class="hands-on" data-astro-cid-xyqj6rpw><p data-astro-cid-xyqj6rpw><strong data-astro-cid-xyqj6rpw>Hands-on test, Oct 9, 2026:</strong>1 of 6 steps passed.
